DESCRIPTION >
    Listed apps ranked by successful, billable Pollen Pay (BYOP) requests in
    the rolling last 7 days. An App Key listed in a catalog entry's
    `appKeyIds` (app.json) is credited to that listing. Other registered App
    Keys fall back to a guess: the one catalog listing of the same owner whose
    URL covers the key's redirect URI, or, without a URL match, the owner's
    only listing. Guesses never land on a listing that declares its keys.
    Ambiguous keys are excluded. Multiple keys for one listing are combined
    before ranking. Refreshed hourly.
    Returns catalog URLs and names, public owner handles, and aggregate counts
    only. No user IDs, App Keys, wallet, revenue, or cost data is exposed.

TOKEN "tinybird_read_public" READ
TOKEN "tinybird_read" READ

NODE endpoint
SQL >
    %
    SELECT app_url, app_name, owner, request_count, last_seen
    FROM app_top_weekly_snapshot
    ORDER BY request_count DESC, last_seen DESC, app_name ASC, app_url ASC
    LIMIT {{ UInt8(limit, 10) }}

TYPE ENDPOINT
